-12 h-12 grid place-items-center rounded-md bg-(--ds-gray-100) p-1.5"><img alt="Claude Code logo" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain w-full h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/agents/claude-code.svg?dpl=dpl_5P5gD5SVNBcS8srDS5foUkTRDWQa"/></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-0.5 truncate">Claude Code</h2><p class="text-xs text-(--ds-gray-700) line-clamp-2">Anthropic&#x27;s official terminal agent. Skills installed via the skills CLI become available as procedural knowledge across every Claude Code session in the project.</p></div></a></li><li><a class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-border p-4 hover:bg-(--ds-gray-100)/30 transition-colors h-full" href="/agent/cursor"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 grid place-items-center rounded-md bg-(--ds-gray-100) p-1.5"><img alt="Cursor logo" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain w-full h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/agents/cursor.svg?dpl=dpl_5P5gD5SVNBcS8srDS5foUkTRDWQa"/></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-0.5 truncate">Cursor</h2><p class="text-xs text-(--ds-gray-700) line-clamp-2">AI-first code editor with deep agent integration. The skills CLI installs SKILL.md files that Cursor agents reference automatically when working on the repo.</p></div></a></li><li><a class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-border p-4 hover:bg-(--ds-gray-100)/30 transition-colors h-full" href="/agent/codex"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 grid place-items-center rounded-md bg-(--ds-gray-100) p-1.5"><img alt="Codex logo" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain w-full h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/agents/codex.svg?dpl=dpl_5P5gD5SVNBcS8srDS5foUkTRDWQa"/></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-0.5 truncate">Codex</h2><p class="text-xs text-(--ds-gray-700) line-clamp-2">OpenAI&#x27;s coding agent. Compatible with the skills CLI for installing reusable procedural knowledge — performance rules, design systems, and workflow patterns.</p></div></a></li><li><a class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-border p-4 hover:bg-(--ds-gray-100)/30 transition-colors h-full" href="/agent/github-copilot"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 grid place-items-center rounded-md bg-(--ds-gray-100) p-1.5"><img alt="GitHub Copilot logo" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain w-full h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/agents/copilot.svg?dpl=dpl_5P5gD5SVNBcS8srDS5foUkTRDWQa"/></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-0.5 truncate">GitHub Copilot</h2><p class="text-xs text-(--ds-gray-700) line-clamp-2">GitHub&#x27;s AI coding assistant. Skills installed via the skills CLI augment Copilot&#x27;s project context with structured guidance the model uses across edits and chats.</p></div></a></li><li><a class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-border p-4 hover:bg-(--ds-gray-100)/30 transition-colors h-full" href="/agent/windsurf"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 grid place-items-center rounded-md bg-(--ds-gray-100) p-1.5"><img alt="Windsurf logo" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain w-full h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/agents/windsurf.svg?dpl=dpl_5P5gD5SVNBcS8srDS5foUkTRDWQa"/></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-0.5 truncate">Windsurf</h2><p class="text-xs text-(--ds-gray-700) line-clamp-2">Codeium&#x27;s agentic IDE. Skills give Windsurf project-specific procedural knowledge that persists across sessions without manual re-prompting.</p></div></a></li><li><a class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-border p-4 hover:bg-(--ds-gray-100)/30 transition-colors h-full" href="/agent/gemini"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 grid place-items-center rounded-md bg-(--ds-gray-100) p-1.5"><img alt="Gemini logo" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain w-full h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/agents/gemini.svg?dpl=dpl_5P5gD5SVNBcS8srDS5foUkTRDWQa"/></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-0.5 truncate">Gemini</h2><p class="text-xs text-(--ds-gray-700) line-clamp-2">Google&#x27;s Gemini family of agents. Compatible with the skills CLI for repo-scoped skill installation — including the Gemini CLI for terminal workflows.</p></div></a></li><li><a class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-border p-4 hover:bg-(--ds-gray-100)/30 transition-colors h-full" href="/agent/cline"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 grid place-items-center rounded-md bg-(--ds-gray-100) p-1.5"><img alt="Cline logo" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain w-full h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/agents/cline.svg?dpl=dpl_5P5gD5SVNBcS8srDS5foUkTRDWQa"/></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-0.5 truncate">Cline</h2><p class="text-xs text-(--ds-gray-700) line-clamp-2">Open-source autonomous coding agent for VS Code. Reads SKILL.md files installed via the skills CLI to apply project-specific patterns automatically.</p></div></a></li><li><a class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-border p-4 hover:bg-(--ds-gray-100)/30 transition-colors h-full" href="/agent/amp"><div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 grid place-items-center rounded-md bg-(--ds-gray-100) p-1.5"><img alt="AMP logo" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain w-full h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/agents/amp.svg?dpl=dpl_5P5gD5SVNBcS8srDS5foUkTRDWQa"/></div><di